      <p begin="01:06.700" end="01:12.070" ttm:agent="v1">Da-da-da-da, da-da-da-da-da-da, da-da-da</p>
      <p begin="01:12.070" end="01:14.050" ttm:agent="v1">Act like an angel and dress like crazy</p>
