      <p begin="01:34.440" end="01:36.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">All the girly girls (What?)</p>
      <p begin="01:36.210" end="01:39.820" ttm:agent="v1">Back in the days, 미침에 미치지 못했던 me</p>
      <p begin="01:39.820" end="01:43.190" ttm:agent="v1">더이상 내 끌림 앞에 거짓 증언은 않지</p>
      <p begin="01:43.190" end="01:47.010" ttm:agent="v1">무슨 의미 또 무슨 가치 가능과 불가능 이젠 다 쉿</p>
      <p begin="01:47.010" end="01:48.510" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, me and my girls</p>
      <p begin="01:48.030" end="01:51.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">우린 눈이 멀 것을 알아도 저 태양에 kiss (Mwah)</p>
      <p begin="01:51.210" end="01:52.740" ttm:agent="v1">갈릴레오</p>
